# Security Design - Zones, ACLs & Layer 2 Hardening

Design Philosophy
Instead of creating an ACL for every VLAN pair, this design groups VLANs into trust zones and applies ACLs between those zones. 
Access is denied by default unless there is a specific business need. This keeps the ACLs manageable while allowing necessary communication between departments.

