Zone C        General Departments	(10, 20, 60, 80, 90, 110, 120, 140,                Can reach shared internal resources (file/print/intranet) and the internet. Default-deny to Zone D.                           
              150, 160, 170, 190, 200)	                                
Zone D        Restricted/Sensitive	30 (Treasurer), 40 (Assessor),                   Locked down. Only specific, named cross-VLAN flows permitted. Management access restricted to IT/MIS.
